[38;5;252m[1m## Bug found and fixed[0m[0m
[0m[0m
One real divergence in [38;5;10mstbds_stralloc[0m. The C computes [38;5;10m(size_t)512 << (block>>1)[0m — the cast happens [3mbefore[23m the shift, so it is a 64-bit shift. The Rust was shifting a [38;5;10mu32[0m, which masks the shift count to 5 bits and truncates the value. Identical for the block values reachable through normal use (≤ 22), divergent for an arena handed in with a larger [38;5;10mblock[0m. Fixed to [38;5;10m(512usize).wrapping_shl(shift)[0m, and [38;5;10mb_arena::row_69_stralloc_preseeded_block[0m now sweeps [38;5;10mblock[0m ∈ {0…30, 126…130, 254, 255} including the counts that are UB in C.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
No other divergence surfaced. The remaining test failures during development were all wrong assumptions in my own test code, not translation bugs.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## How tightly the comparison is drawn[0m[0m
[0m[0m
After [3mevery single operation[23m the harness diffs the full observable state of both [38;5;10m.so[0ms: array header ([38;5;10mlength[0m/[38;5;10mcapacity[0m/[38;5;10mtemp[0m), all nine hash-index bookkeeping fields plus the arena, [1mevery slot of every bucket[22m (all hash values and all indices — so probe order, tombstone placement and rehash layout are compared bit-for-bit, not just the answers), the element payload, and the exact [38;5;10m*temp[0m sentinel. [38;5;10mtable->temp_key[0m is excluded because [38;5;10mstbds_make_hash_index[0m leaves it uninitialised; it is checked separately by pointed-to string right after each string-mode put, where the C does define it.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The gnarly [38;5;10mstb_ds[0m quirks are pinned deliberately: the [38;5;10mint[0m sign-extension in [38;5;10md[3] << 24[0m (which makes the top 32 bits of every siphash block all-ones), the asymmetric [38;5;10mtemp_key[0m update between the two half-scans, [38;5;10mmode == STBDS_HM_STRING[0m being an exact compare in [38;5;10mhmdel_key[0m while everything else uses [38;5;10m>=[0m, and out-of-range [38;5;10mmode[0m/[38;5;10mshmode[0m ints crossing FFI (full sweep 0…257 plus the extremes).[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Not executed, and why[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Eleven [38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m rows are documented rather than executed. Eight are [38;5;10massert[0ms or missing null checks unreachable through the public API — firing them [38;5;10mSIGABRT[0ms the C [38;5;10m.so[0m and takes the harness down, proving nothing; they are covered indirectly because the C [38;5;10m.so[0m is built with asserts live, so any bookkeeping divergence would abort the C side during a Phase B/C test. Rows 11/23 ([38;5;10mif (hash < 2) hash += 2[0m) need a siphash preimage of 0 or 1 — 2⁻⁶³, not constructible; instead 200 000 randomized inputs pin the premise that both libraries hash identically. Row 15 is structurally impossible and the invariant is verified over a 600-op churn.[0m[0m
